{"id":"vd-a1-the-old-photo","level":"a1","n":14,"title":{"en":"This Was Park Street","vi":"Đây là phố Park ngày xưa"},"summary":"Ivy hỏi ông Walter về tấm ảnh đen trắng — con phố, rạp chiếu phim và chàng trai đội mũ sáu mươi năm trước.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-old-photo","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Old Photo","vi":"Tấm ảnh cũ"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"book","x":800}]},"cast":{"ivy":{"name":{"en":"Ivy","vi":"Ivy"},"look":"girl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#C98A3C","top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765"}},"walter":{"name":{"en":"Grandpa Walter","vi":"Ông Walter"},"look":"grandpa","x":1120,"style":{"glasses":true,"skin":"#C98E68","skinShade":"#B07650","top":"#6B7F9E","topShade":"#56698A"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ivy","en":"Grandpa, look at this old photo!","vi":"Ông ơi, nhìn tấm ảnh cũ này này!","ipa":["ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","lʊk","æt","ðɪs","oʊld","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ"],"start":0.554,"end":2.944,"expression":"happy","thoughtBubble":"photo:walter","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.376],[2,1.589],[3,1.745],[4,2.015],[5,2.356]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"Oh! Where was it?","vi":"Ồ! Cháu tìm thấy nó ở đâu thế?","ipa":["oʊ","wɛɹ","wɑz","ɪt"],"start":3.734,"end":5.724,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,3.734],[1,4.996],[2,5.294],[3,5.535]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"In your desk. Who is the young man?","vi":"Trong bàn của ông ạ. Chàng trai trẻ này là ai ạ?","ipa":["ɪn","jɔɹ","dɛsk","hu","ɪz","ðə","jʌŋ","mæn"],"start":6.514,"end":9.854,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.514],[1,6.668],[2,6.91],[3,8.493],[4,8.777],[5,8.99],[6,9.09],[7,9.445]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"That was me! I was twenty.","vi":"Là ông đấy! Hồi đó ông hai mươi tuổi.","ipa":["ðæt","wɑz","mi","aɪ","wɑz","ˈtwɛnti"],"start":10.644,"end":13.244,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,10.644],[1,10.821],[2,11.048],[3,12.251],[4,12.45],[5,12.691]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"You were young! And where was this?","vi":"Hồi đó ông trẻ quá! Thế đây là ở đâu ạ?","ipa":["ju","wɝ","jʌŋ","ənd","wɛɹ","wɑz","ðɪs"],"start":14.034,"end":17.264,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,14.034],[1,14.219],[2,14.503],[3,15.973],[4,16.2],[5,16.513],[6,16.769]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"This was Park Street, sixty years ago.","vi":"Đây là phố Park, sáu mươi năm trước.","ipa":["ðɪs","wɑz","pɑɹk","stɹit","ˈsɪksti","jɪɹz","əˈɡoʊ"],"start":18.054,"end":20.924,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,18.054],[1,18.255],[2,18.454],[4,19.704],[5,20.173],[6,20.485]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"Were there big shops?","vi":"Hồi đó có cửa hàng lớn không ạ?","ipa":["wɝ","ðɛɹ","bɪɡ","ʃɑps"],"start":21.714,"end":23.074,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,21.714],[1,21.848],[2,22.104],[3,22.388]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"No. There were small shops, and there was a cinema.","vi":"Không. Chỉ có những cửa hàng nhỏ, và có một rạp chiếu phim.","ipa":["noʊ","ðɛɹ","wɝ","smɔl","ʃɑps","ənd","ðɛɹ","wɑz","ə","ˈsɪnəmə"],"start":23.864,"end":28.254,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,23.864],[1,25.122],[2,25.349],[3,25.519],[4,25.974],[5,26.997],[6,27.21],[7,27.352],[8,27.536],[9,27.65]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"Was it a good cinema?","vi":"Rạp có hay không ạ?","ipa":["wɑz","ɪt","ə","ɡʊd","ˈsɪnəmə"],"start":29.044,"end":30.374,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,29.044],[1,29.231],[2,29.373],[3,29.472],[4,29.77]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"It was the best! I was there every Saturday.","vi":"Hay nhất luôn! Thứ Bảy nào ông cũng ở đó.","ipa":["ɪt","wɑz","ðə","bɛst","aɪ","wɑz","ðɛɹ","ˈɛvɚi","ˈsætɚdi"],"start":31.164,"end":34.704,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,31.164],[1,31.265],[2,31.479],[3,31.606],[4,32.923],[5,33.122],[6,33.349],[7,33.576],[8,33.946]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"Every Saturday? Why?","vi":"Thứ Bảy nào cũng đi ạ? Sao thế ạ?","ipa":["ˈɛvɚi","ˈsætɚdi","waɪ"],"start":35.494,"end":37.994,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,35.494],[1,35.833],[2,37.558]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"Your grandma was there, too.","vi":"Vì bà cháu cũng ở đó.","ipa":["jɔɹ","ˈɡɹændmɑ","wɑz","ðɛɹ","tu"],"start":38.784,"end":40.604,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,38.784],[1,38.928],[2,39.439],[3,39.681],[4,40.036]]},{"speaker":"ivy","en":"Grandpa! Is the cinema still there?","vi":"Ông ơi! Rạp chiếu phim đó vẫn còn chứ ạ?","ipa":["ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","ɪz","ðə","ˈsɪnəmə","stɪl","ðɛɹ"],"start":41.394,"end":44.634,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,41.394],[1,43.018],[2,43.231],[3,43.373],[4,43.87],[5,44.282]]},{"speaker":"walter","en":"I don't know. Let's go and see!","vi":"Ông không biết. Mình đi xem đi!","ipa":["aɪ","doʊnt","noʊ","lɛts","ɡoʊ","ənd","si"],"start":45.424,"end":48.334,"expression":"happy","react":{"ivy":"happy"},"timing":[[0,45.424],[1,45.53],[2,45.729],[3,46.917],[4,47.301],[5,47.585],[6,47.755]]}],"words":[{"id":"young","en":"young","ipa":"jʌŋ","vi":"trẻ; nhỏ tuổi; non","level":0},{"id":"cinema","en":"cinema","ipa":"ˈsɪnəmə","vi":"rạp chiếu phim; điện ảnh","level":0},{"id":"photo","en":"photo","ipa":"ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","vi":"ảnh; bức ảnh","level":0},{"id":"shop","en":"shop","ipa":"ʃɑp","vi":"cửa hàng; đi mua sắm","level":0},{"id":"old","en":"old","ipa":"oʊld","vi":"già; cũ; … tuổi","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Nói về quá khứ với \"was / were\"","pattern":"Who was…? · I was… · There was / There were… · It was…","explain":"\"Was\" (số ít: I/he/she/it) và \"were\" (số nhiều: you/we/they) là quá khứ của \"be\". \"There was + danh từ số ít\", \"There were + danh từ số nhiều\" để tả ngày xưa có gì.","keys":["was","were","there was","there were"],"lines":[1,3,4,5,6,7,8,9,11]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-the-old-photo.mp3","v":"ba572ab6b5","duration":49.44,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}